# Build-context pruning for the commit image. The full repo, including .git history, is baked into
# /mayhem (the grader needs it), so only local build output and editor/OS noise is dropped here.

# Out-of-tree build trees that mayhem/build.sh creates under mayhem/_build/ (rebuilt in the image).
mayhem/_build/

# Editor / OS noise
**/__pycache__/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
